<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal's jobless rose yr/yr in Dec, down m/m.</title>
<headline>Portugal's jobless rose yr/yr in Dec, down m/m.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The number of registered unemployed in Portugal fell 0.5 percent month-on-month in December 1996 to 460,244, up 1.9 percent year-on-year, the Institute for Employment and Professional Training (IFEP) said.</p>
<p>				    Dec 96   Nov 96    Dec 95</p>
<p> Registered unemployed     460,244   462,511   451,801</p>
<p>NOTE - The IEFP does not express the number of unemployed as a percentage of the total labour force. Its figures for the number of people out of work are consistently higher than those of the National Statistics Institute (INE) -- the government's official yardstick for unemployment.</p>
<p>-- Lisbon newsroom 3511-3538254</p>
</text>
